## Goal

Implement the assignment requirement to display the calculated polygon area
while the user is drawing.

This task is primarily frontend UX.

The user should be able to see the current polygon area in square kilometers
while constructing a polygon.

Conceptually:

start drawing polygon
    ↓
add/move vertices
    ↓
calculate current client-side area
    ↓
display area in km²
    ↓
continue drawing
    ↓
update displayed value
    ↓
finish drawing
    ↓
normal existing save flow

## Important distinction

The live frontend calculation is informational only.

The backend remains authoritative for persisted Area.areaKm2.

Do NOT change the persisted-area calculation semantics unless investigation
shows that the current backend implementation is incorrect.

After save:

    frontend live estimate
        != source of truth

    backend calculated areaKm2
        = source of truth

The frontend must not send a trusted areaKm2 value to the backend merely to
avoid server-side calculation.

