## UX

Keep the UI minimal.

While drawing a polygon, display something conceptually like:

    Area: 1.24 km²

The value should update as the polygon changes.

Investigate the cleanest location based on the current map UI.

Possible approaches include:

- a small Leaflet/map control;
- a small overlay near the existing drawing controls;
- using existing Leaflet Draw measurement UI if it already provides the
  required result cleanly.

Do not create a large panel or modal.

The value should not obscure important map controls.

## Lifecycle

Define behavior for at least:

- drawing starts;
- first vertices are added;
- polygon becomes valid enough to calculate;
- additional vertices are added;
- drawing finishes;
- drawing is cancelled;
- drawing is deleted before save;
- switching base map while drawing.

The measurement UI must not remain stale after drawing is cancelled or
completed.

