## Calculation

The displayed value must be in square kilometers.

Investigate the existing coordinate representation and available Leaflet
geometry helpers.

Explain the calculation method and its accuracy characteristics.

Do not silently use a planar formula on latitude/longitude coordinates if
that would produce materially incorrect results.

Also compare the frontend live calculation conceptually with the backend
authoritative calculation.

If they use different algorithms, document that small differences may occur.

## Precision / formatting

Propose sensible display formatting.

For example:

    0.003 km²
    1.24 km²
    125.6 km²

Avoid excessive decimal noise.

Do not change database precision in this task.

